#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Difficulty level title"
msgid "Configurable"
msgstr "Prilagodljivo"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:77
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "Start Tutorial"
msgstr "Pokreni vodič"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Start tutorial"
msgstr "Pokreni vodič"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>The <b>tutorial</b> is a fast, user friendly and interactive way to "
"learn the rules of the game. Start it if you do not know them!</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>Vodič</b> je brz, jednostavan i interaktivan način učenja pravila "
"igre. Pokrenite ga ako ih ne poznajete!</qt>"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "New Sandbox Game"
msgstr "Nova igra u načinu vježbanja"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Start a new sandbox game"
msgstr "Pokreni novu igru u načinu vježbanja"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>In a <b>sandbox game</b>, the solution is displayed at the beginning "
"of the game. This is useful to understand the game principles.</"
"p><p>However: after a while, it is not really fun and you should try to "
"start a real game!</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>U <b>igri za vježbanje</b> rješenje se prikazuje na početku igre. "
"To je korisno za razumijevanje načela igre.</p><p>No, nakon nekog vremena "
"to više nije zabavno pa biste trebali pokušati pokrenuti pravu igru!</p></qt>"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:92
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@action the last action of a game to check the result, when the user is done"
msgid "Done!"
msgstr "Gotovo!"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><ul><li>First, you have to place all the balls on the black box. To "
"guess the correct positions of the balls and see how they interact with "
"laser beams, you should use the lasers that are positioned around the black "
"box.</li><li><b>When you think you are done</b>, you should click here.</"
"li></ul><p>Note that it is only possible to click here if you have placed "
"the correct number of balls.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><ul><li>Najprije postavite sve kuglice na crnu kutiju. Da biste otkrili "
"njihove točne položaje i vidjeli kako međudjeluju s laserskim zrakama, "
"upotrijebite lasere raspoređene oko crne kutije.</li><li><b>Kada mislite da "
"ste gotovi</b>, kliknite ovdje.</li></ul><p>Ovdje možete kliknuti samo ako "
"ste postavili točan broj kuglica.</p></qt>"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:97
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Give up the game"
msgstr "Odustani od igre"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:98
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>Choose \"<b>Solve</b>\" if you want to give up the current game. The "
"solution will be displayed.</p><p>If you placed all the balls and do not "
"want to give up, choose \"Done!\".</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>Odaberite „<b>Riješi</b>” ako želite odustati od trenutačne igre. "
"Prikazat će se rješenje.</p><p>Ako ste postavili sve kuglice i ne želite "
"odustati, odaberite „Gotovo!”.</p></qt>"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:103
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Enable Highlight under Mouse"
msgstr "Isticanje ispod pokazivača miša"

