#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"The text may not be too wide. So please use some HTML-BR-tags to have "
"something more or less as wide as in english. Thanks!"
msgid ""
"Note: You can change<br />the parameters of<br />custom games in the<br /"
">Settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"Napomena: parametre<br />prilagođenih igara možete<br />promijeniti u "
"dijalogu<br />Postavke."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:280
#, kde-format
msgid "First, you need to remove 1 ball from the black box."
msgid_plural "First, you need to remove %1 balls from the black box."
msgstr[0] "Najprije morate ukloniti 1 kuglicu iz crne kutije."
msgstr[1] "Najprije morate ukloniti %1 kuglice iz crne kutije."
msgstr[2] "Najprije morate ukloniti %1 kuglica iz crne kutije."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:282
#, kde-format
msgid "To check if you successfully guessed the ball positions, click here!"
msgstr "Kliknite ovdje da biste provjerili jeste li ispravno pogodili položaje kuglica!"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:284
#, kde-format
msgid "You need to place 1 more ball on the black box."
msgid_plural "You need to place %1 more balls on the black box."
msgstr[0] "Morate postaviti još 1 kuglicu na crnu kutiju."
msgstr[1] "Morate postaviti još %1 kuglice na crnu kutiju."
msgstr[2] "Morate postaviti još %1 kuglica na crnu kutiju."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid "Game over."
msgstr "Igra je završena."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:290
#, kde-format
msgid "Game paused."
msgstr "Igra je pauzirana."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:329
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on \"Done!\" is the normal way to check the positions of the balls "
"at the end of the game. However, it is not possible in the tutorial to end "
"the game before you reached the last step.\n"
"Please first finish the tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Klik na „Gotovo!” uobičajen je način provjere položaja kuglica na kraju "
"igre. Međutim, u vodiču ne možete završiti igru prije nego što dođete do "
"posljednjeg koraka.\n"
"Najprije dovršite vodič."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:329
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Check Positions"
msgstr "Provjera položaja"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:336
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"The text may not be too wide. So please use some HTML-BR-tags to have "
"something more or less as wide as in english. Thanks!"
msgid "Your final score is: %1.<br />You did really well!"
msgstr "Vaš konačni rezultat je: %1.<br />Bili ste zaista uspješni!"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:338
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"The text may not be too wide. So please use some HTML-BR-tags to have "
"something more or less as wide as in english. Thanks!"
msgid "But it does not count<br />because <b>it is the sandbox!</b>"
msgstr "No ne računa se<br />jer je ovo <b>igra za vježbanje!</b>"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:340
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"The text may not be too wide. So please use some HTML-BR-tags to have "
"something more or less as wide as in english. Thanks!"
msgid "Your final score is: %1.<br />I guess you need more practice."
msgstr "Vaš konačni rezultat je: %1.<br />Čini se da vam treba još vježbe."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:369
#, kde-format
msgid "Game paused.<br />Press \"%1\" to resume."
msgstr "Igra je pauzirana.<br />Pritisnite „%1” za nastavak."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:391
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you want to cancel the current custom game and start a new one with the "
"new parameters?"
msgstr "Želite li prekinuti trenutačnu prilagođenu igru i pokrenuti novu s novim parametrima?"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:392 kbbmainwindow.cpp:481
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Start New Game"
msgstr "Pokreni novu igru"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:408
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:tab"
msgid "Custom Game"
msgstr "Prilagođena igra"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:427
#, kde-format
msgid "Sorry, you may not give up during the tutorial."
msgstr "Nažalost, tijekom vodiča ne možete odustati."

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:427
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Solve"
msgstr "Riješi"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:430
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You placed all the balls. Great!\n"
"You should now click on \"Done!\" to end the game and check if you guessed "
"correctly.\n"
"So, do you really want to give up this game?"
msgstr ""
"Postavili ste sve kuglice. Odlično!\n"
"Sada kliknite „Gotovo!” da biste završili igru i provjerili jeste li ih "
"ispravno smjestili.\n"
"Želite li doista odustati od ove igre?"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:430 kbbmainwindow.cpp:432
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Give Up"
msgstr "Odustani"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:432
#, kde-format
msgid "You should place %1 ball!\n"
msgid_plural "You should place %1 balls!\n"
msgstr[0] "Trebate postaviti %1 kuglicu!\n"
msgstr[1] "Trebate postaviti %1 kuglice!\n"
msgstr[2] "Trebate postaviti %1 kuglica!\n"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:432
#, kde-format
msgid "You have placed %1.\n"
msgid_plural "You have placed %1.\n"
msgstr[0] "Postavili ste %1.\n"
msgstr[1] "Postavili ste %1.\n"
msgstr[2] "Postavili ste %1.\n"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:432
#, kde-format
msgid "Do you really want to give up this game?"
msgstr "Želite li doista odustati od ove igre?"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:442
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"The text may not be too wide. So please use some HTML-BR-tags to have "
"something more or less as wide as in english. Thanks!"
msgid ""
"Note: In the sandbox mode,<br />the solution is already displayed.<br />Have "
"fun!"
msgstr ""
"Napomena: u načinu vježbanja<br />rješenje je već prikazano.<br />Zabavite se!"

#: kbbmainwindow.cpp:481
#, kde-format
msgid "This will be the end of the current game!"
msgstr "Time će trenutačna igra završiti!"

#: kbbscalablegraphicwidget.cpp:100
#, kde-format
msgid "Score"
msgstr "Rezultat"

#: kbbscalablegraphicwidget.cpp:101
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>This is <b>your score</b>. You should try to get the lowest possible."
"</p><p>The score increases:<ul><li>with time: <b>1 point</b> per second.</"
"li><li>with the use of lasers:<ul><li><b>3 points</b> if the laser beam hits "
"a ball or exits at the entry point,</li><li><b>9 points</b> if it exits at "
"another entry point.</li></ul></li></ul></p><p>Your score is set to <b>999</"
"b> at the end of the game if you make a mistake.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>Ovo je <b>vaš rezultat</b>. Pokušajte ostvariti što manji rezultat."
"</p><p>Rezultat se povećava:<ul><li>s vremenom: <b>1 bod</b> u sekundi.</"
"li><li>upotrebom lasera:<ul><li><b>3 boda</b> ako laserska zraka pogodi "
"kuglicu ili izađe na mjestu ulaska,</li><li><b>9 bodova</b> ako izađe na "
"drugom mjestu ulaska.</li></ul></li></ul></p><p>Ako pogriješite, na kraju "
"igre rezultat će vam biti postavljen na <b>999</b>.</p></qt>"

#: kbbscalablegraphicwidget.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>This is the <b>main game area</b>.</p><ul><li>The <b>black box</b> is "
"in the center.</li><li>On the left, there are the <b>balls</b> you have to "
"place over the black box.</li><li>Around the black box, there are <b>lasers</"
"b> that are replaced with <b>interaction information</b> if you use them.</"
"li></ul></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>Ovo je <b>glavno područje igre</b>.</p><ul><li><b>Crna kutija</b> "
"nalazi se u sredini.</li><li>Lijevo su <b>kuglice</b> koje trebate "
"postaviti na crnu kutiju.</li><li>Oko crne kutije nalaze se <b>laseri</b>, "
"koje nakon upotrebe zamjenjuju <b>podaci o međudjelovanju</b>.</li></ul></qt>"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:36
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "Vodič"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:53
#, kde-format
msgid "Displays the progress of the tutorial."
msgstr "Prikazuje napredak vodiča."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:75
#, kde-format
msgid "Describes what you should do to reach the next tutorial step."
msgstr "Opisuje što trebate učiniti da biste prešli na sljedeći korak vodiča."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button Previous tutorial step"
msgid "&Previous"
msgstr "&Prethodno"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid "Go back to the previous tutorial step."
msgstr "Vrati se na prethodni korak vodiča."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:88
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button Next tutorial step"
msgid "&Next"
msgstr "&Sljedeće"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:89
#, kde-format
msgid "Go to the next tutorial step."
msgstr "Idi na sljedeći korak vodiča."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:151
#, kde-format
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Dobro došli!"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:151
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This tutorial will teach you how to play KBlackBox, using a simple example."
"<br /><br />We are playing with a square black box of 6 columns and 6 rows. "
"It has 3 balls <b>hidden</b> inside it and 24 laser probes around it.<br /"
"><br />The goal is to <b>find the positions of the balls.</b>"
msgstr ""
"U ovom ćete vodiču naučiti igrati KBlackBox uz jednostavan primjer."
"<br /><br />Igramo s kvadratnom crnom kutijom sa 6 stupaca i 6 redaka. "
"U njoj su <b>skrivene</b> 3 kuglice, a oko nje su 24 laserske sonde.<br /"
"><br />Cilj je <b>otkriti položaje kuglica.</b>"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:151
#, kde-format
msgid "Click on \"Next\""
msgstr "Kliknite „Sljedeće”"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:156
#, kde-format
msgid "Black box principles"
msgstr "Načela igre s crnom kutijom"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:156
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The balls are not visible, but we can shoot laser beams into the box at "
"different entry points and observe if the laser beams leave the box, and if "
"they do, where they come out.<br /><br />The laser beams interact with the "
"balls in various ways."
msgstr ""
"Kuglice se ne vide, ali možemo ispaljivati laserske zrake u kutiju na "
"različitim mjestima ulaska te promatrati izlaze li zrake iz kutije i, ako "
"izlaze, na kojem mjestu.<br /><br />Laserske zrake međudjeluju s kuglicama "
"na različite načine."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:156
#, kde-format
msgid "Please click on the marked laser to shoot a beam into the black box."
msgstr "Kliknite označeni laser da biste ispalili zraku u crnu kutiju."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid "No interaction"
msgstr "Bez međudjelovanja"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If a laser beam does not interact with any ball in the black box, it comes "
"out at the point opposite the entry point.<br /><br />Example: Suppose we "
"have 3 balls in the box as shown. They will not affect laser beam \"1\".<br /"
"><br />As the game progresses, each pair of entry/exit points is marked with "
"a different number."
msgstr ""
"Ako laserska zraka ne stupi u međudjelovanje ni s jednom kuglicom u crnoj "
"kutiji, izlazi na mjestu nasuprot mjestu ulaska.<br /><br />Primjer: "
"Pretpostavimo da su u kutiji 3 kuglice, kao što je prikazano. One neće "
"utjecati na lasersku zraku „1”.<br /><br />Kako igra napreduje, svaki par "
"mjesta ulaska i izlaska označava se drugim brojem."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid "Now shoot the marked laser to discover the first kind of interaction."
msgstr "Sada ispalite označeni laser da biste otkrili prvu vrstu međudjelovanja."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgid "Hit"
msgstr "Pogodak"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A direct impact on a ball is called a \"<b>hit</b>\". A beam that hits a "
"ball does <b>not</b> emerge from the black box.<br /><br />Example: The beam "
"might have hit a ball at the position shown, but the exact position of the "
"hit is not certain: There are many other possibilities."
msgstr ""
"Izravan udarac u kuglicu naziva se „<b>pogodak</b>”. Zraka koja pogodi "
"kuglicu <b>ne</b> izlazi iz crne kutije.<br /><br />Primjer: Zraka je možda "
"pogodila kuglicu na prikazanom mjestu, ali točan položaj pogotka nije "
"siguran jer postoji mnogo drugih mogućnosti."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgid "Shoot the marked laser to discover the second kind of interaction."
msgstr "Ispalite označeni laser da biste otkrili drugu vrstu međudjelovanja."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:175
#, kde-format
msgid "Simple deflection"
msgstr "Jednostavno skretanje"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:175
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The interaction of a beam that does not actually hit a ball, but aims to one "
"side of it, is called a \"<b>deflection</b>\". The angle of deflection of "
"the beam is always <b>90 degrees</b>.<br /><br />Example: The ball shown "
"would deflect beam \"2\" upward, as shown, but this is <b>not</b> the only "
"possibility."
msgstr ""
"Međudjelovanje pri kojem zraka ne pogodi kuglicu, već prolazi uz njezinu "
"stranu, naziva se „<b>skretanje</b>”. Kut skretanja zrake uvijek iznosi "
"<b>90 stupnjeva</b>.<br /><br />Primjer: prikazana kuglica skrenula bi "
"zraku „2” prema gore, kao što je prikazano, no to <b>nije</b> jedina "
"mogućnost."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:175
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Click on \"Next\" to see another combination of ball positions that deflects "
"the laser beam as shown."
msgstr "Kliknite „Sljedeće” da biste vidjeli drugi raspored kuglica koji skreće lasersku zraku kao što je prikazano."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:182
#, kde-format
msgid "Several deflections"
msgstr "Višestruka skretanja"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:182
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"As you can see, interactions in the black box can be quite complicated!<br /"
">A laser beam entering and exiting at the positions \"2\" might have been "
"deflected by this configuration of 3 balls."
msgstr ""
"Kao što vidite, međudjelovanja u crnoj kutiji mogu biti prilično složena!"
"<br />Ovaj raspored 3 kuglice mogao bi skrenuti lasersku zraku koja ulazi i "
"izlazi na mjestima označenima brojem „2”."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:182
#, kde-format
msgid "Shoot the marked laser to discover another kind of result."
msgstr "Ispalite označeni laser da biste otkrili drugu vrstu ishoda."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:190
#, kde-format
msgid "Reflection"
msgstr "Odraz"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:190
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the laser beam leaves the black box <b>at the entry point</b>, it has "
"been reflected backward inside the black box.<br /><br />Example: We have "
"placed 2 balls for you in a configuration that would lead to such a "
"reflection."
msgstr ""
"Ako laserska zraka izađe iz crne kutije <b>na mjestu ulaska</b>, odbila se "
"natrag unutar crne kutije.<br /><br />Primjer: Postavili smo 2 kuglice u "
"raspored koji bi izazvao takav odraz."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:190
#, kde-format
msgid "Shoot the marked laser to see another backward reflection case."
msgstr "Ispalite označeni laser da biste vidjeli još jedan slučaj povratnog odraza."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgid "Special reflection"
msgstr "Poseban odraz"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If a ball is <b>at the edge of the box</b> (with no other ball nearby), a "
"beam which is aimed into the black box directly beside it causes a backward "
"reflection.<br /><br />Example: The configuration shown can cause a backward "
"reflection."
msgstr ""
"Ako je kuglica <b>na rubu kutije</b> (bez drugih kuglica u blizini), zraka "
"usmjerena u crnu kutiju neposredno uz nju izaziva povratni odraz."
"<br /><br />Primjer: prikazani raspored može izazvati povratni odraz."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgid "Nearly done. Click on \"Next\"."
msgstr "Gotovo ste. Kliknite „Sljedeće”."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:204
#, kde-format
msgid "Marker for \"free position\""
msgstr "Oznaka za „slobodno mjesto”"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:204
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"We are sure there are no balls in the first 2 columns. If there were any, "
"the beam entering at position \"1\" would hit a ball or be deflected by a "
"ball in column 2. You can mark a \"free position\" with a right mouse click "
"(see also keyboard shortcuts).<br /><br />Example: There are 12 markers in "
"the first 2 columns."
msgstr ""
"Sigurni smo da u prva 2 stupca nema kuglica. Da ih ima, zraka koja ulazi na "
"mjestu „1” pogodila bi kuglicu ili bi je skrenula kuglica u drugom stupcu. "
"„Slobodno mjesto” možete označiti desnim klikom miša (pogledajte i "
"tipkovne prečace).<br /><br />Primjer: u prva 2 stupca nalazi se 12 oznaka."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:204 kbbtutorial.cpp:213
#, kde-format
msgid "Click on \"Next\"."
msgstr "Kliknite „Sljedeće”."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:213
#, kde-format
msgid "Marking balls"
msgstr "Označavanje kuglica"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:213
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When you have worked out where a ball is, please use the left mouse button "
"to mark it. To remove a ball mark, use the left mouse button again. Last "
"tip: If you are not sure about a position, you can use a right click on a "
"ball to mark it as \"unsure\". (See also keyboard shortcuts.)<br /><br /"
">Example: We marked one position as sure, the other one as unsure."
msgstr ""
"Kada otkrijete gdje se nalazi kuglica, označite je lijevom tipkom miša. "
"Ponovno kliknite lijevom tipkom da biste uklonili oznaku kuglice. Još "
"jedan savjet: ako niste sigurni u položaj, desnom tipkom miša kliknite "
"kuglicu da biste je označili kao „nesigurnu” (pogledajte i tipkovne "
"prečace).<br /><br />Primjer: jedan smo položaj označili kao siguran, a "
"drugi kao nesiguran."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:220
#, kde-format
msgid "Let us play!"
msgstr "Zaigrajmo!"

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:220
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Congratulations!</b> You now know <b>all the rules</b> for KBlackBox.<br /"
"><br /><b>You can start to play.</b> Try to finish this tutorial game by "
"yourself!<br /><br />Tip: We have sent in enough beams to deduce the "
"positions of the 3 balls with certainty. Of course, you can use some more "
"shots if needed."
msgstr ""
"<b>Čestitamo!</b> Sada znate <b>sva pravila</b> igre KBlackBox.<br /"
"><br /><b>Možete početi igrati.</b> Pokušajte sami dovršiti ovu igru "
"iz vodiča!<br /><br />Savjet: Ispalili smo dovoljno zraka da biste sa "
"sigurnošću odredili položaje 3 kuglice. Naravno, po potrebi možete ispaliti "
"još koju zraku."

#: kbbtutorial.cpp:220
#, kde-format
msgid "Finish placing the balls and click on \"Done!\" when you are done!"
msgstr "Dovršite postavljanje kuglica pa kliknite „Gotovo!”"

